//LETTERS
"appleseed.BCP.DyeGuideLetter": "^^^^^					$",
"appleseed.BCP.DyeGuideLetterTitle": "Dye Guide",
"appleseed.BCP.CurioBookLetter": "(It's an old, heavy book wrapped in paper and tied securely with string. There's no return address...)",
"appleseed.BCP.CurioBookLetterTitle": "Mysterious Tome Delivery",

"appleseed.BCP.BaublesIntro": "Congratulations on your move, @. It's not a step many have the imagination to take, but you've always been quite the creative - which is why I'm sending you some blueprints and notes from my time as a toymaker. I hope this knowledge will help fill your new life with joy as it did mine. Whatever path you choose now, you have my well wishes.^^	-Love, Aunt Charlotte",
"appleseed.BCP.BaublesIntroTitle": "Aunt Charlotte's Letter",

"appleseed.BCP.WizardRequest": "Greetings, @. I have a request for you.^Some time ago I came into possession of a parchment surrounded with magical energy, which I have sent alongside this letter. It seems to be a recipe for alchemizing a unique and powerful substance, but I have so far failed to produce it...^If you're able to decipher it, please bring its product to my tower. I will reward you for your efforts.^  -M.Rasmodius, Wizard",
"appleseed.BCP.WizardRequestTitle": "Wizard Requests Assistance",

"appleseed.BCP.WhimsychineHint": "^(It's a collage of different fairytale snippets that have been stitched together...)^-In a silken stump, the fairy queen's bones were put to rest-^  -'Bring me five pieces of the sun so that my guests and I may warm ourselves!' Said the-^-He cut the darkness into five black slices-^  -The moonfrog's ten children all dove into the well-^-and the next day I found my heart's desire.",
"appleseed.BCP.WhimsychineHintTitle": "Fairytale Riddle",

"BCP.AbigailOrderComplete": "Hey, @!^Thanks a lot for your help with the tea set. Mom appreciates it so much that I don't have to pay for the old one anymore, haha...^Here's a thank-you gift. Hope you like it!   ^^   -Abigail",
"BCP.AbigailOrderCompleteTitle": "A Crisis Averted",

"BCP.EvelynOrderComplete": "Hello, dear.^I'm writing to thank you for your help with my knitting project.^I managed to make a few nice things... including a sweater I've put in the mail for you. Remember to layer up when it gets cold out!   ^^   -Evelyn",
"BCP.EvelynOrderCompleteTitle": "A Knit Sweater",

"BCP.MarnieOrderComplete": "Hi, farmer @!^Aunt Marnie doesn't know I'm writing this yet, but I saw the new toys she had behind the counter and I know they're for me and that you made them so I'm writing you a thank-you letter. I was really sad when my dolls started coming apart and we had to throw them away, but I feel a lot better now because there are really nice people like you and Ms. Penny here. I promise I'll take good care of them.^P.S. This drawing is for you, it's a really pretty bunny that I saw on your farm. Okay, goodbye!   ^   -Sincerely, Jas",
"BCP.MarnieOrderCompleteTitle": "A Drawing From Jas",

"BCP.HaleyOrderComplete": "So, @, the embroidery actually went really well!^I pricked myself a few times, but in the end I made a bunch of super cute stuff I'm pretty proud of.^Here's one I think you'll like. See you soon!   ^^   -Haley",
"BCP.HaleyOrderCompleteTitle": "Embroidery From Haley",

"BCP.LeahOrderComplete": "@, thanks so much for the paint! You're a real lifesaver.^In return, I'm sending you one of the pieces I created with it... Let me know what you think!   ^^   -Leah",
"BCP.LeahOrderCompleteTitle": "All-Organic Art",

"BCP.HarveyOrderComplete": "Thanks for providing us with those flowers, @.^Working with them gave us fresh appreciation for the remedies found in nature... remedies that still require some processing, of course.^The recipe for this tonic is thankfully quite simple, but if you're ever in need of more, we've added it to our stock at the clinic.   ^^   -Dr. Harvey",
"BCP.HarveyOrderCompleteTitle": "Floral Medicine",

"BCP.PennyOrderComplete": "@, hello!^I'm writing to let you know that the idea I had is working wonderfully! The kids are able to focus much better now, especially Vincent. The only downside is that they keep asking to take the props home with them...^^Here's something to help keep you going, too.   ^^   -Penny",
"BCP.PennyOrderCompleteTitle": "Apples From Penny",

"BCP.AlexOrderComplete": "Hey, @.^My grandma really loved those figurines! I don't know how you make them, but thanks for helping me out.^She wanted to thank you too, so I sent the cookies she made for you with this letter.   ^^   -Alex",
"BCP.AlexOrderCompleteTitle": "Precious Moments",

"BCP.PierreOrderComplete": "Dear @,^Thanks a million for those pelican plushies! I have a feeling they're going to sell like crazy next season... You've got a real lucrative skillset!^I thought it was only fair I send you a piece of my handiwork as well... A limited edition t-shirt! You're already a resident, but never hurts to show your love for your home turf, right?   ^^   -Pierre",
"BCP.PierreOrderCompleteTitle": "A Successful Venture",

"BCP.JodiOrderComplete": "Hi Farmer @, this is Vincent! Thank you for all the cool toys!^Mom said I should write you a thank-you letter with something nice in it, so I'm doing that right now.^Don't know where the nice thing is? It's on the back of this paper! It's a flower from the beach. I was gonna pick it but I felt bad about that so I drew it instead. And you're a farmer so I thought you must like flowers too.^That's the end of my letter!   ^^   -Vincent",
"BCP.JodiOrderCompleteTitle": "Something Nice From Vincent",

"BCP.LewisOrderComplete": "Hello, @.^This is the head of Ferngill Star Blessings.^We'd like to thank you for your contributions to making the children of Ferngill's hearts that much warmer this winter season.^^Please accept this gift from us to you!   ^^   -Ferngill Star Blessings Organization",
"BCP.LewisOrderCompleteTitle": "Imbibe In Blessings",

//QUESTS

"appleseed.BCP.IntroQuestTitle": "Intro To Toymaking",
"appleseed.BCP.IntroQuestDescription": "Your great aunt sent you instructions for making an Atelier Table. There's a lot you could probably do with it...",
"appleseed.BCP.IntroQuestHint": "Build an Atelier Table and use it to craft a Seaglobe.",

"appleseed.BCP.WhimsychineQuestTitle": "Solving A Magic Riddle",
"appleseed.BCP.WhimsychineQuestDescription": "The Wizard needs help creating a substance based on cryptic instructions. You'll probably need the new machine you've learned how to build...",
"appleseed.BCP.WhimsychineQuestHint": "Bring the Wizard a Petrichor Heart.",
"appleseed.BCP.WhimsychineQuestSolved": "Aha, you've solved it! So this is the essence that's been eluding me.$h#$b#I see... remarkable. This is unlike anything I've encountered before.$0#$b#Thank you for your assistance, @. If you come across more of these catalysts, I'd greatly appreciate you letting me inspect them.$0",

