//SPECIAL ORDERS - ORDER TEXT

"BCP.AbigailOrder.Text": "Hi, could anyone make me a few porcelain Teacups and a Teapot? I need to make up for a... slingshot-related accident.",
"BCP.EvelynOrder.Text": "This weather has me wanting to take up knitting again, but I've run clean out of thread...",
"BCP.MarnieOrder.Text": "A lot of Jas' dolls fell into a sorry state over the years, and recently, some of them completely fell apart! We'd both love to find her some replacements.",
"BCP.HaleyOrder.Text": "So, I want to try getting into embroidery, but I don't want to ask Emily for her stuff if I'll just be like... messing up a bunch. I'll need some dyed wool to practice with.",
"BCP.LeahOrder.Text": "Hi! Does anyone know where I can get some organic paint? My usual supplier is unavailable, and I'm almost out of materials to make more myself...",
"BCP.HarveyOrder.Text": "Maru and I are researching the medicinal potential of certain wildflowers. Would any local foragers mind collecting the samples we need?",
"BCP.PennyOrder.Text": "Environmental science can get a little dry on days where the children and I are indoors... so we'll have to bring the outside in! If it's no trouble, I'd like some fun props to incorporate into my lesson plans.",
"BCP.AlexOrder.Text": "Gram's done a lot for me, and I want to show my appreciation for her... she's pretty into those little ceramic figures.",
"BCP.PierreOrder.Text": "Our festivals have been bringing in a lot more tourism lately... I say we take advantage of our little town's growing popularity with some charming souvenirs! I'll handle the t-shirts.",
"BCP.JodiOrder.Text": "Vincent's been doing very well in school, and I want to surprise him... the problem is, I can't get a hold of any of the toys he wants from that monster game he likes. I'd love to commission some similar ones.",
"BCP.LewisOrder.Text": "Ferngill's annual 'Star Blessings' winter charity has begun accepting donations! I'm welcoming anyone feeling extra generous this season to pitch in. We're accepting clothing, media, and especially toys -- the more, the merrier!",

